Design a circuit that reverses the order of bits in a 16-bit input vector. The module extracts the first 8 bits and second 8 bits from the input, swaps their positions, and constructs the output vector such that the first half (bits 15 to 8) becomes the last half of the output, and the second half (bits 7 to 0) becomes the first half of the output.
